# Google Gemini API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://ai.google.dev/
# NOTE: Vite requires the VITE_ prefix to expose variables to the client
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Optional: Development server configuration
VITE_PORT=3000
VITE_HOST=0.0.0.0

# IMPORTANT SECURITY WARNING:
# ⚠️  This application exposes the API key in the client-side JavaScript bundle!
# ⚠️  This is ONLY suitable for local development and educational purposes.
#
# For production deployment, you MUST:
# 1. Create a backend API server (Node.js, Python, etc.)
# 2. Move all Gemini API calls to the backend
# 3. Implement proper authentication and rate limiting
# 4. Use server-side environment variables (not VITE_ prefixed)
# 5. Never commit .env.local to version control
#
# Anyone with access to your deployed frontend can extract and abuse your API key!
